{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/444347-de-emphasizing-hierarchy","id":444347,"title":"De- Emphasizing Hierarchy","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-16T09:11:54-07:00","id":444347,"title":"De- Emphasizing Hierarchy","content":"How can I tone down the intra-werewolf hierarchy - like pack alphas, show me your belly, that kind of thing. It's just a personal preference but I don't want to break something else in the game . Thanks","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3927-demon15","name":"Demon15","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-16T09:19:14-07:00","id":444372,"title":"","content":"As far as I know, there's not really any mechanics tied to that kind of thing, so all you'd have to do is not emphasize that kind of dynamic.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-16T09:22:24-07:00","id":444390,"title":"","content":"Things like pack alphas are not a necessary part of the game; packs run under all sorts of different structures, from alpha-led tyrannies to equal-say partnerships to specialist-led packs where a given Auspice takes over when dealing with issues that are part of their specialised remit, and plenty more besides.<br /> <br /> Even without a strict hierarchy, I'd still expect werewolves to <i>clash</i> a lot - they're passionate sorts for whom physical violence is mostly a trivial consequence - but you can ignore notions such as alphas easily withouit breaking anything in the game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-16T11:36:06-07:00","id":444628,"title":"","content":"Great, thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3927-demon15","name":"Demon15","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}